    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n    我们留意到，关于首日体验的调研，您已通过您所持有的另一重身份给予了我们宝贵的建议。依照约定，本次的答谢礼将由灵界信使直接为您送至邮箱，请您查收。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷1</>\n    若您希望以当前的身份再次留下您的意见，也可以继续通过邮件中的隐秘通道传递您的想法，我们始终欢迎您的建议。\n    感谢您对这段旅程的见证，愿灵性为您指引前路。"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n    We have noticed that regarding the first-day experience survey, you have already provided us with valuable suggestions through another identity you hold. According to the agreement, this thank-you gift will be sent directly to your mailbox by the Spirit World messenger; please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 1</>\n    If you wish to leave your opinions again with your current identity, you can continue to convey your thoughts through the secret channel in the email; we always welcome your suggestions. \n    Thank you for witnessing this journey, may your Духовность guide your path.",
